          <p>Short quotes from papers stay the property of their authors and publishers. The structure around them is shared under CC BY 4.0.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <details class="devbox">
        <summary>For developers: check the numbers yourself</summary>
        <div class="code on-dark">
          <pre data-scroll-region data-label="Commands to check the numbers">{reproduce}</pre>
